Cell["Section 8.4.6:  Set up annular monodromes ", "Subsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.982224998965021*^9, 3.9822250583704357`*^9}, 
   3.9822251811576366`*^9, {3.986976588485656*^9, 
